  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>z</mi><mi>&#160;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></mfrac><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is a purely imaginary number and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mi>z</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math>, then a value of <math><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is :"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>1</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
